Completes the auth flow by adding the two missing pieces: OAuth callback handling and sign-out.

- **`app/auth/callback/route.ts`** — Standard Supabase PKCE code exchange via `GET` route handler. Redirects to `/dashboard` on success, `/` on failure.
- **`app/auth/signout/page.tsx`** — Client component that calls `signOut()` on mount with `try/finally` redirect to `/`. Shows RPG-themed transition UI.
- **`docs/ROLEVERSE.txt`** — Updated `callback/page.tsx` → `callback/route.ts` to reflect the standard Supabase pattern instead of a page component.

```ts
// auth/callback/route.ts — exchange OAuth code for session
export async function GET(request: Request) {
  const { searchParams, origin } = new URL(request.url);
  const code = searchParams.get('code');

  if (code) {
    const supabase = await createClient();
    const { error } = await supabase.auth.exchangeCodeForSession(code);
    if (!error) return NextResponse.redirect(`${origin}/dashboard`);
  }

  return NextResponse.redirect(`${origin}/`);
}
```

